// Title: Automated Collection Command Prompt
// Sigma ID: f576a613-2392-4067-9d1a-9345fb58d8d1
// Status: test | Level: medium
// Author: frack113
// Date: 2021-07-28 | Modified: 2022-11-11
// ATT&CK: collection, T1119, credential-access, T1552.001
// Description: Once established within a system or network, an adversary may use automated techniques for
//   collecting internal data.
// False positives:
//   - Unknown
// References:
//   - https://github.com/redcanaryco/atomic-red-team/blob/f339e7da7d05f6057fdfcdd3742bfcf365fee2a9/atomics/T1119/T1119.md
//   - https://github.com/redcanaryco/atomic-red-team/blob/f339e7da7d05f6057fdfcdd3742bfcf365fee2a9/atomics/T1552.001/T1552.001.md
// Sigma rule: https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/adf5a626c4a776f3f023056f0f398b9523a2f09e/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_susp_automated_collection.yml
// License: Detection Rule License (DRL) 1.1 - https://github.com/SigmaHQ/Detection-Rule-License
// Converted by sigma2kql (target: microsoft_xdr, pySigma 1.5.1, pySigma-backend-kusto 1.0.1)
// Validation: passed (Kusto.Language 12.4.1, live Defender schema)
// Machine-generated and not tested against real telemetry. Verify before use as a detection.

DeviceProcessEvents
| where (ProcessCommandLine contains ".doc" or ProcessCommandLine contains ".docx" or ProcessCommandLine contains ".xls" or ProcessCommandLine contains ".xlsx" or ProcessCommandLine contains ".ppt" or ProcessCommandLine contains ".pptx" or ProcessCommandLine contains ".rtf" or ProcessCommandLine contains ".pdf" or ProcessCommandLine contains ".txt") and ((ProcessCommandLine contains "dir " and ProcessCommandLine contains " /b " and ProcessCommandLine contains " /s ") or (ProcessVersionInfoOriginalFileName =~ "FINDSTR.EXE" and (ProcessCommandLine contains " /e " or ProcessCommandLine contains " /si ")))
